"""
TrafficFlow AI — Stage 4: Spatiotemporal Traffic Risk & Multi-Horizon Early-Warning Engine
========================================================================================
Combines:
- Direct Multi-Horizon Machine Learning Models (5 min, 10 min, 15 min Direct Predictions)
- Base & Calibrated Random Forest Models
- Temporal Risk Momentum (TRM)
- Spatial Congestion Pressure (SCP)
- Propagation Shock-Wave Index (PSI)
- Alert Hysteresis & Debouncing Filter
- Validation-Driven Operating Threshold Optimization
- Diurnal & Temporal Regime Robustness (Rush Hours, Midday, Night, Weekend)
- Sensor Outage & Hardware Stress Testing (0%, 5%, 10%, 20%, 30%, Cluster & Packet Loss)
- Data-Driven TLCC Propagation Direction & Stability Validation
"""

